/*
  bundles/verify_phase.spthy -- the VERIFY_KEY phase repertoire in one include.
  Producer (the fingerprint UI: genuine + tampered) + the Attentive/Naive answers + the sigma6
  Abstraction stressor (Attentive->Naive). Naive accepts a tampered fingerprint (the mistake).

  Requires a !Session, so pair with protocol/session.spthy and a CALC producer plus
  bundles/human_common.spthy. Adding a new VERIFY stressor = one include line here.
*/

